Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,Seventeen thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to the NRMA,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:06.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,that's how much some electric car owners\Non a novated lease could lose in tax
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:11.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,savings because of a change that\Nstarts on the 1st of April 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:14.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,And that's just one of the changes\Ncoming for Aussie EV drivers next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,In July 2027,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:20.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,New South Wales plans to start\Ncharging electric car owners for every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,kilometre they drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:26.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,Also in 2027, a new luxury car tax\Nthreshold is due for electric vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:30.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the emissions rules that have been\Npushing car makers to discount EVs get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:31.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,a lot tougher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:33.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,Some of these changes will save you money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:34.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,Some will cost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:35.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,And depending on when you buy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:38.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,which state you live in and\Nhow you pay for your car,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,the difference could be\Nthousands of dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:41.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,So in this video,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:45.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,I'll go through every major change\Ncoming for electric car buyers and owners
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:48.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,in Australia in 2027 what's confirmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:49.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,what's still being decided,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:52.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,and what it means if you're thinking\Nabout buying an EV in the next few
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:53.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:57.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, because the timing of\Nyour purchase has never mattered more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:01:00.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the big one:\Nthe Electric Car Discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:04.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,Since 2022, electric cars\Nprovided by an employer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.22,0:01:05.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,including through a novated lease,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.86,0:01:09.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,have been exempt from fringe benefits\Ntax as long as they're under the luxury
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.46,0:01:12.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,car tax threshold for\Nfuel-efficient vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:17.07,Doc,,0,0,0,,That threshold is currently $91,387.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:21.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you've never used one, here's how\Na novated lease works in simple terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:25.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's an agreement between you, your\Nemployer and a leasing company.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:27.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,Your employer pays the\Ncar's costs the lease,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:30.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,and often running costs like insurance,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:34.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,servicing and charging out of your\Nsalary before income tax is taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:36.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,That lowers your taxable income.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.60,0:01:39.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,Normally, that benefit\Nattracts fringe benefits tax,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:40.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,which eats into the saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:43.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,For eligible EVs, that tax has been zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:45.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,For a lot of Australians,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:47.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,this has been the single\Nbiggest reason to buy an EV.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.78,0:01:51.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,A novated lease lets you pay for\Nthe car out of your pre-tax salary,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:55.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,and with no fringe benefits tax\Non top, the savings can be huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:59.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,The National Automotive Leasing and\NSalary Packaging Association's chief
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:00.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,executive, Rohan Martin,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.86,0:02:05.07,Doc,,0,0,0,,has called it "Australia's most effective\Ndemand-side lever for EV uptake."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,But it's been expensive\Nfor the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:10.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,A statutory review found that "the\Nrevenue costs of the Electric Car Discount
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:12.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,are increasing significantly",
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:16.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,and that "alternative policy approaches\Nmay be more fiscally efficient and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:18.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,equitable." And it's been popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:22.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,Leasing industry groups have pointed\Nto the discount as a major reason EV
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:23.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,sales took off,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:26.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,especially among middle-income workers\Nwho could suddenly afford a new car
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.82,0:02:29.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,they'd never have\Nconsidered paying cash for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:30.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,So in May 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:34.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,the government confirmed the discount\Nwould be wound back in three stages.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:36.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,Here's exactly how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:41.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,Stage one: until the 31st of\NMarch 2027, nothing changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:46.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,EVs under the fuel-efficient luxury car\Ntax threshold keep the full exemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:51.75,Doc,,0,0,0,,Stage two: from the 1st of April\N2027 to the 31st of March 2029,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:56.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,the full exemption only applies\Nto EVs costing $75,000 or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:58.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,Electric cars above $75,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:01.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,but still under the\Nluxury car tax threshold,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.34,0:03:05.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,get a twenty-five per cent discount on\Ntheir fringe benefits tax instead of a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:06.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,full exemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:09.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,Stage three: from the 1st of April 2029,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:12.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,all eligible EVs get the\Ntwenty-five per cent discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:14.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,The full exemption is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:16.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,And there are two important details.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:18.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,First, existing leases are protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:21.71,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you're already in an eligible\Nnovated lease before the change,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:22.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,you're grandfathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:24.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,What does "grandfathered"\Nmean in practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:28.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,It means the rules that applied when\Nyour lease started keep applying for that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:28.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,lease.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:31.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,You don't suddenly lose the\Nexemption halfway through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:35.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,But when that lease ends and you take\Nout a new one, the new rules will apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:40.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,Second, plug-in hybrids already lost\Ntheir exemption on the 1st of April 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.52,0:03:43.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,So this is only about fully electric cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:47.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,The NRMA estimated that some novated\Nlease EV owners could lose more than
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:50.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,seventeen thousand dollars in\Ntax savings under the changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,Your own number depends on your salary,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.06,0:03:55.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,the car's price, the lease length\Nand the kilometres you drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:58.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Electric Vehicle Council welcomed\Nthe fact that the discount was extended
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:00.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,rather than scrapped outright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:03.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,Its chief executive, Julie Delvecchio,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:06.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,said it was "good news for everyday\NAustralians who are doing the sums on
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:07.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,going electric."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:09.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,So what does this mean for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:12.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you're looking at an EV under $75,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:17.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,the change on the 1st of April 2027\Ndoesn't affect you at least until 2029.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:20.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,That covers a huge\Nchunk of the market now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:22.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,In February 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:25.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarsGuide listed seven electric cars\Navailable for under forty thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:28.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,dollars drive-away,\Nincluding the BYD Dolphin,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:34.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,the MG4, the GWM Ora, the Chery E5, the\NLeapmotor B10 and the Hyundai Inster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:41.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the BYD Atto 1 started from\N$23,990 before on-road costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.10,0:04:44.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,But if you're looking at an EV\Nbetween $75,000 and the luxury car tax
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:49.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,threshold think larger SUVs and\Npremium models the date matters a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:53.71,Doc,,0,0,0,,Sign an eligible novated lease\Nbefore the 1st of April 2027,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:55.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,and you lock in the full exemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:58.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,Sign after, and you only get the\Ntwenty-five per cent discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:02.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's why I'd expect a rush of more\Nexpensive EV leases in the first three
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:04.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,months of 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:08.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,And it's why you should talk to your\Nemployer and your lease provider now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:11.83,Doc,,0,0,0,,rather than in March, when everyone\Nelse is trying to do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:13.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,One warning: delivery times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:17.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,A lease generally needs the car to\Nactually be provided to you for the benefit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:21.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,to apply, so check with your\Nprovider how the timing works.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:25.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,If the car you want has a long wait,\Nordering in late March might be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:29.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, the second change:\Nthe luxury car tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:32.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,Right now, cars over a certain price pay\Nan extra tax of thirty-three per cent
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:35.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,on every dollar above the threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:37.93,Doc,,0,0,0,,For fuel-efficient vehicles,\Nincluding electric cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:41.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,that threshold is $91,387.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:44.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,On the 24th of March 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:47.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,Prime Minister Anthony Albanese announced\Na free trade deal with the European
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:48.83,Doc,,0,0,0,,Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:49.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,As part of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:53.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australia agreed to remove the five\Nper cent tariff on European passenger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.26,0:05:54.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:58.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,And CarExpert reported a new luxury\Ncar tax category for zero-emissions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:06:01.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,vehicles, with a threshold of $120,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:08.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,that new zero-emissions threshold is\Ndue to start on the 1st of July 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:10.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,The trade deal still needs\Nto be formally ratified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,What does that mean in dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,Here's a simple illustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:20.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,Today, an EV priced at $100,000\Nis $8,613 over the threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:26.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,At thirty-three per cent, that's\Nabout $2,842 in luxury car tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:31.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,Under a $120,000 threshold, the same\Ncar would pay no luxury car tax at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:33.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,But don't get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:36.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,James Voortman, chief executive of\Nthe Australian Automotive Dealer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:40.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,Association, welcomed the trade deal\Nbut described the luxury car tax change
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:44.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,as "a narrow change that will only\Naffect less than one per cent of vehicles
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:48.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,sold." So this helps buyers\Nof premium EVs think Polestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:53.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,BMW, Mercedes-Benz, Porsche and Audi\Nmuch more than buyers of an everyday BYD
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:54.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,or MG.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.25,0:06:58.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,Before we get to the change that could\Naffect every EV owner in New South
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:07:00.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,Wales, a quick favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:03.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,Do you drive an EV, or are you\Nthinking about getting one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:06.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,Would any of these 2027\Nchanges make you buy sooner,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:07.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,or put you off completely?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:09.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,Tell me in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:10.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,And if you want honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.38,0:07:14.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,fact-checked videos about what's\Nchanging for Aussie drivers in 2027,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:15.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,hit subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:16.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,It really helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:21.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, the change that's causing the\Nbiggest argument: paying per kilometre.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:24.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,Every time you fill up with petrol\Nor diesel, you pay fuel excise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.87,0:07:28.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,That money goes to the federal budget,\Nand a large share is spent on roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:31.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,EV drivers don't buy fuel,\Nso they don't pay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:35.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,And fuel excise has been\Nin the spotlight in 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.09,0:07:36.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,During the fuel crisis,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:38.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,the federal government\Ntemporarily halved it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:42.20,Doc,,0,0,0,,from 52.6 cents a litre to 26.3 cents,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:44.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,from the 1st of April\Nuntil the 1st of July.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.69,0:07:49.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,The NRMA also noted that the share of\Nfuel excise reinvested in roads fell to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.63,0:07:52.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,seventy per cent in the 2026 budget,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:55.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,down from seventy-nine per\Ncent forecast a year earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:58.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,So the question of who pays for\Nroads is only getting bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:02.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,Chasing Cars estimated that EVs cost\Nthe federal government roughly $130
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:08.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,million to $165 million a\Nyear in lost fuel excise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:12.28,Doc,,0,0,0,,New South Wales plans to fix that with\Na road user charge from July 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:17.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,Chasing Cars reported the proposed\Nrates as about 2.974 cents per kilometre
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:22.74,Doc,,0,0,0,,for electric vehicles and 2.379 cents\Nper kilometre for plug-in hybrids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:27.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,AAP reported it was forecast to raise\N$440 million in its first three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.77,0:08:29.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,What would that cost you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:31.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,At 12,000 to 15,000 kilometres a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:37.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,Chasing Cars calculated an EV\Ndriver would pay about $360 to $450.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:41.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,For comparison, a petrol car using seven\Nlitres per hundred kilometres would
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:48.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,pay around $440 to $550 a year in\Nfuel excise over the same distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:49.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,And notice something:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:51.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,plug-in hybrids would pay the charge too,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:55.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,even though they also burn petrol\Nand pay fuel excise when they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:58.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's one of the reasons critics\Nsay the design needs work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:09:00.12,Doc,,0,0,0,,But there's a legal problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:05.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,Victoria introduced a similar charge\N2.8 cents per kilometre for EVs and in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:09.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,2023 the High Court found that only the\Nfederal government can levy that kind
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:10.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,of tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.35,0:09:12.20,Doc,,0,0,0,,So how can NSW go ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:17.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,NSW Treasurer Daniel Mookhey has said\NNSW would prefer a national system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.35,0:09:19.96,Doc,,0,0,0,,But, quote, "in the absence\Nof a national system,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.01,0:09:24.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,it remains the intent of the NSW\Ngovernment to enact the law." He suggested
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:28.60,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Commonwealth could refer its powers\Nto NSW to avoid another court defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:33.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,As of mid-2026, NSW hadn't said\Nexactly how it would collect the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:35.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,And what about a national charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.99,0:09:40.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,In 2025, Treasurer Jim Chalmers said the\Ngovernment was "accelerating work" on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:42.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,an EV road user charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.61,0:09:43.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,But in April 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:48.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,Transport Minister Catherine King told\Nthe ABC she wasn't sure there was a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:50.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,path to pass one through parliament,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:53.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,and that "it may not be the time for\Nit right now." The May 2026 federal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:55.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,budget didn't include one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:59.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,The government said it was "continuing\Nto work with states and territories."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.51,0:10:00.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,So in 2027,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:04.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,you could end up with one state\Ncharging EV drivers and the rest of the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:07.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,country not unless Canberra steps in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:09.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,The reaction has been\Nstrong on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.03,0:10:13.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,A NSW Government spokesperson argued\Nthat "everybody who uses roads should
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:18.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,contribute to them." The NRMA and the\NElectric Vehicle Council have both
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:21.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,supported a road user charge in principle\Nbut the Electric Vehicle Council
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.67,0:10:25.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,argued it should only start once EVs\Nmake up thirty per cent of the national
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:26.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:28.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,Its chief executive, Julie Delvecchio,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:33.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,said the NSW tax "fails on all three\Nfronts." The council cited Sydney
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.39,0:10:37.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,University research finding twenty-eight\Nper cent of likely EV buyers would be
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:39.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,dissuaded, and pointed to New Zealand,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.77,0:10:44.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,where it said the EV share of sales\Nfell from 20.6 per cent to 3.8 per cent
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:46.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,after a similar move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.49,0:10:50.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,Polestar Australia's boss Scott Maynard\Ncalled a national charge on EVs a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:54.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,"thinly veiled tax." It's worth\Nputting those numbers side by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:58.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,An average EV driver in NSW might pay\Na few hundred dollars a year under the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:10:59.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,proposed charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:02.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,A petrol car doing the same\Ndistance pays a similar amount,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:07.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,or more, in fuel excise plus the\Nmuch higher cost of the fuel itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,So even with a road user charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:13.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,running an EV on home charging is still\Nlikely to be cheaper for most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:16.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,The question is whether the charge\Narrives before EVs are affordable for
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:17.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.83,0:11:18.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,My take?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:22.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,Some form of road user charge for EVs\Nlooks very likely in the long run,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:26.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,because fuel excise is shrinking\Nas more people go electric.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:28.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,The real fight is about when it starts,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:29.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,how much it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:32.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,and whether it's fair compared with\Nwhat petrol and diesel drivers pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:37.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, here's the change that could\Nactually make EVs cheaper in 2027:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:39.07,Doc,,0,0,0,,the emissions rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:41.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,Under the New Vehicle Efficiency Standard,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:45.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,the target for passenger cars drops\Nfrom 117 grams of carbon dioxide per
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:49.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,kilometre in 2026 to 92 grams in 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:52.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's a cut of more than twenty\Nper cent in a single year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:57.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,Then 68 grams in 2028, and 58 in 2029.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:12:00.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,Car makers that miss their targets build\Nup penalties of roughly fifty dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.72,0:12:01.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,per gram per vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:06.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,The best way to avoid them is to\Nsell more electric and hybrid cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:09.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the fastest way to sell\Nmore EVs is to cut prices.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,We've already seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:17.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,Hyundai cut up to $13,857 from some\Nversions of the Kona Electric in 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:21.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,And CarsGuide reported that the government's\NClean Energy Finance Corporation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:24.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,committed sixty million dollars to\NHyundai Capital Australia to help offer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:27.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,cheaper finance on Hyundai and Kia EVs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:29.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,And it isn't just about price cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,The tougher the targets get,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:34.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,the more EV and hybrid models car\Nmakers need to bring to Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:38.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,More than sixty new EV models were\Nexpected to enter the Australian market as
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:40.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,the scheme started.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.06,0:12:41.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,More choice usually\Nmeans more competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:45.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,and more competition\Nusually means better deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,The market is already moving fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:50.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Australian Automobile Association\Nreported that battery electric and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.46,0:12:55.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,plug-in hybrid vehicles made up 31.61\Nper cent of new light vehicle sales in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:57.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,the June quarter of 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:59.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,By September 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:03.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,battery electric cars made up more than\Ntwenty-four per cent of new car sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:07.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarExpert reported that EVs outsold both\Npetrol and diesel vehicles in August
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:10.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,and September 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:11.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,And as we covered in our last video,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:16.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,the federal opposition has promised to\Nscrap the NVES if it wins government so
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:18.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,this part of the picture could change too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:22.07,Doc,,0,0,0,,And there's one more change from\Nthe 2026 budget worth knowing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:25.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,The government committed forty million\Ndollars to new regional and kerbside
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.75,0:13:26.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,chargers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:29.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,That matters, because a lack of charging\Nis still one of the biggest reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:33.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,people give for not buying an EV,\Nespecially outside the big cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:38.71,Doc,,0,0,0,,So, should you buy an\NEV before 2027, or wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:40.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,Here's how I'd think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:44.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you're buying an EV over\N$75,000 through a novated lease:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:47.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,the deadline is the 31st of March 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.96,0:13:49.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,Get your lease in place before then,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:52.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,and check how delivery timing\Nworks with your provider.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:57.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you're buying a premium EV\Nbetween about $91,000 and $120,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:13:59.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,paying cash or with a normal loan:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:04.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,the new luxury car tax threshold\Nis due from the 1st of July 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:08.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,Waiting could save you thousands but\Nonly if the trade deal is ratified on
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:08.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:12.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,Ask the dealer how they'll handle the\Ntiming, and get any promise in writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:14.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you live in New South Wales:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:20.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,budget for a possible road user charge\Nfrom July 2027 roughly $360 to $450
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:24.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,a year for an average driver,\Nbased on the proposed rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.06,0:14:27.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's still less than the fuel\Nexcise most petrol cars pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:28.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,but it's a new cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.50,0:14:29.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you're buying a cheaper EV,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:35.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,under $75,000: the fringe benefits tax\Nchange doesn't affect you until 2029.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:38.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,And with tougher\Nemissions targets in 2027,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:41.28,Doc,,0,0,0,,there's a good chance car makers\Nwill keep pushing EV discounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.33,0:14:45.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,Shop around, compare drive-away\Nprices, and don't rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:46.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,And think about resale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:50.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,Rules that make new EVs cheaper or more\Nexpensive can also move the value of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:51.75,Doc,,0,0,0,,used ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:55.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,If luxury car tax falls on\Npremium EVs from July 2027,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:59.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,for example, buyers may compare a used\Npremium EV with a cheaper new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.72,0:15:02.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,Nobody can predict exactly\Nhow prices will move,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,so buy a car you're happy\Nto keep for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:08.83,Doc,,0,0,0,,And whatever you do, don't let a\Ndeadline push you into the wrong car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:11.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,A tax saving doesn't help if\Nthe car doesn't suit your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:16.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,So, here's 2027 for Aussie\NEV drivers in a nutshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:18.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,On the 1st of April 2027,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:23.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,the full fringe benefits tax exemption\Nis limited to EVs costing $75,000 or
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:24.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,less.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:27.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,Plug-in hybrids already\Nlost theirs in 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.58,0:15:29.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,In July 2027,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:32.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,NSW plans to start charging\NEV drivers per kilometre,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:34.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,unless the federal government steps in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:36.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,Also from July 2027,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:41.93,Doc,,0,0,0,,a new $120,000 luxury car tax threshold\Nis due for zero-emissions vehicles,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:44.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,if the European trade deal is ratified.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:48.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,And tougher emissions targets will keep\Npushing car makers to sell more EVs
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:50.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,which could mean more discounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:51.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,So, mark these dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:54.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,The 31st of March 2027:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:58.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,the last day for the full exemption\Non EVs over $75,000 in a new novated
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:15:59.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,lease.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:02.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,The 1st of April 2027:\Nthe new rules start.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:05.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,The 1st of July 2027:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.22,0:16:09.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,the new luxury car tax threshold\Nfor zero-emissions vehicles is due,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:11.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the NSW road user charge is planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.92,0:16:13.71,Doc,,0,0,0,,And through all of 2027:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,tougher emissions targets for car makers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:17.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,and a government review of those rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:19.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,Some of these changes cost money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:20.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,Some save money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:23.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,All of them make timing\Nmore important than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:25.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,If this helped, hit like, subscribe,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:28.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,and share it with someone who's\Nthinking about going electric.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:29.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,Tell me in the comments:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:32.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,will these changes make you\Nbuy an EV sooner, or later?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:33.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,And in the next video,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:37.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,we'll look at the new cars coming to\NAustralia in 2027 and which ones could
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:38.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,shake up the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:39.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,See you there.
